			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722110801,
					"content": "是汝啊，来得正好。正好奴家有事情要人帮忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110802,
					"content": "怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110803,
					"content": "多亏了汝，现在神社也比以前好了。很快很快就会有很多很多人来神社了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110804,
					"content": "奴家叮嘱小家伙们，到时候可不能像现在这样，一定要在人类面前保持风度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110805,
					"content": "但它们已经疯惯了，不爱听奴家的话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110806,
					"content": "不过奴家想到了一个办法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110807,
					"content": "办法？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110808,
					"content": "奴家还很小很小的时候，也喜欢到处玩。那时候，阿响为了让奴家和别的猫乖乖听话，会做很好吃的饭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110809,
					"content": "好、好吃的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110810,
					"content": "那时候呀，只要那锅饭一端出来，猫们马上就会从树上、屋顶上下来。就算饭好烫好烫、舌头好热好热，也忍不住。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110811,
					"content": "阿响每次都会做好大一锅，分给猫和人类一起吃，来神社的人也有份。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110812,
					"content": "不过，百目鬼的食量可大了，每次吃好多好多。不像奴家这样有风度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110813,
						722110814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110813,
					"content": "所以说…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110815,
					"content": "不错，很有悟性嘛。奴家要请汝等做饭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110816,
					"content": "我不是怀疑寝子的智慧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110817,
					"content": "不过寝子真的知道饭要怎么做吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110818,
					"content": "喵喵？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110819,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110820
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110820,
					"content": "这、这种东西，就交给汝等想办法了！难道什么都要奴家自己做吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110821,
					"content": "哎呀，不过那个饭，真是太好吃了哪。那个味道，就算走了好远好远、过了好久好久，都可以闻到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110822,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我觉得我们还是应该努力一下！毕竟，为了神社嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110823,
						722110824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110823,
					"content": "饭里有什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110826
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110826,
					"content": "奴家当然记得。有鱼的肉、动物的肉、水里长的草，还有白米。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110827,
					"content": "唔，就是鱼肉、兽肉、海草和稻米对吧…怎么做的还记得吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110828,
					"content": "不记得。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110829,
						722110831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「寝子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110829,
					"content": "看来得找个厨师问问。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110830
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110830,
					"content": "但是，哪个厨师会做猫饭呢…不如我们去问问大祐和悦子吧，他们说不定知道要怎么办。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110831,
					"content": "去找那两个冒险家问问看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110832
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110832,
					"content": "对喔，大祐和悦子是冒险家，说不定他们会知道些什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110824,
					"content": "派蒙真好懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110825
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722110825,
					"content": "什么嘛，我可是热心助猫！寝子，饭里有什么材料，还记得吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722110814,
					"content": "我们帮你做饭？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722110815
					]
				}
			]
